EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Contact.FirstName},
Student ID: {!Contact.EMPLID__c}
Thank you for submitting your application for graduation from Arizona State University. At this time, your application has been placed in review for the following reason:
Your current ASU cumulative grade point average (GPA) is below 2.00. A minimum cumulative GPA of 2.00 for all courses taken at ASU is required to graduate with a baccalaureate degree. Some programs may require a GPA higher than 2.00. Please refer to your specific program’s major map for graduation requirements. Failure to obtain the minimum ASU cumulative GPA by the end of the requested graduation semester will prevent you from graduating.
Please speak with your advisor if you have questions. If you will not meet the requirements in the original semester you requested, you will need to reapply, with no additional fee, for a future graduation date.
Sincerely, {!Case.OwnerFullName}
Graduation University Registrar Services Arizona State University Phone: (480) 965-3256 www.asu.edu
If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.
